{"id":"3cb0b5b1c6108aea","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction.md","title":"df-lambda-binding-and-reduction","display":"df-lambda-binding-and-reduction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction","aliases":["72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction"],"display":"df-lambda-binding-and-reduction","depends_on":[],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; supplementary primary sources explicitly identified","source_location":"Supplement: Girard–Lafont–Taylor, Proofs and Types (1989), https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf, ch.3 §§3.1–3.3, ch.11; supplement Coquand–Huet, INRIA RR-0530 (1986), §§1–3 (local named-syntax/PTS reconstruction; actual PDF version identified in 72-df-calculus-of-constructions)","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","proof_status":"local structural construction checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-lambda-binding-and-reduction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; supplementary primary sources explicitly identified"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Supplement: Girard–Lafont–Taylor, Proofs and Types (1989), <a href=\"https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf</a>, ch.3 §§3.1–3.3, ch.11; supplement Coquand–Huet, INRIA RR-0530 (1986), §§1–3 (local named-syntax/PTS reconstruction; actual PDF version identified in 72-df-calculus-of-constructions)"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local structural construction checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定互不相交的可数无限变量集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_t,V_T\">\\(V_t,V_T\\)</span>、各自的枚举及构造标签；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf C\">\\(\\mathsf C\\)</span> 是无变量常元集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Base}\\subseteq\\mathsf C\">\\(\\mathsf{Base}\\subseteq\\mathsf C\\)</span>，两者与所有标签、变量不交。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,z\\in V_t\">\\(x,y,z\\in V_t\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,V,W\\in V_T\">\\(U,V,W\\in V_T\\)</span>。以下语法为有限树的自由构造语法；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 是类型树，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N\">\\(M,N\\)</span> 是项树。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_\\lambda\">\\(\\mathcal A_\\lambda\\)</span> 是非依赖类型语法，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 是下式构造的原始表达式集合。</li>\n<li>通用项构造是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,c,MN,\\lambda x:A.M,\\Pi x:A.B,\\Lambda U.M,M[A]\">\\(x,c,MN,\\lambda x:A.M,\\Pi x:A.B,\\Lambda U.M,M[A]\\)</span>；各具体系统只使用其明确允许的子语法。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 为无变量常元；STLC/F 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 不含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_t\">\\(V_t\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\{\\lambda,\\Pi\\}\">\\(b\\in\\{\\lambda,\\Pi\\}\\)</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi\">\\(\\Pi\\)</span> 把其体 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 作为通用表达式。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>；原始递归中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E,F,G,H,L,M,N\">\\(E,F,G,H,L,M,N\\)</span> 遍历相应合法的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 表达式。非依赖类型子句、类型应用参数及类型代入参数取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,A&#39;,B\\in\\mathcal A_\\lambda\">\\(A,A&#39;,B\\in\\mathcal A_\\lambda\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda/\\Pi\">\\(\\lambda/\\Pi\\)</span> 的类型注解允许取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 中的合法表达式。</li>\n<li>重命名式中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q,r\\in V_t\\cup V_T\">\\(q,r\\in V_t\\cup V_T\\)</span> 同种类，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 避开被操作树的全部变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\in V_t\\cup V_T\">\\(v\\in V_t\\cup V_T\\)</span>。类型语法的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathsf{Base}\">\\(c\\in\\mathsf{Base}\\)</span>，其余常元子句的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathsf C\">\\(c\\in\\mathsf C\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\square\\notin\\mathsf C\\cup V_t\\cup V_T\">\\(\\square\\notin\\mathsf C\\cup V_t\\cup V_T\\)</span> 是与原语法标签不同的孔标签；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 遍历下式的单孔原始树集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K_\\alpha\">\\(\\mathcal K_\\alpha\\)</span>。填孔关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(C,E,G)\">\\(\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(C,E,G)\\)</span> 沿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 的严格子树递归；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C[E]\">\\(C[E]\\)</span> 仅在下式定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_{\\rm fill}\">\\(\\mathcal D_{\\rm fill}\\)</span> 上使用，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 表示唯一描述。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_\\alpha\">\\(G_\\alpha\\)</span> 只取两次填孔均有定义的实例。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 为任意集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq X^2\">\\(R\\subseteq X^2\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_\\alpha,=_\\alpha\">\\(G_\\alpha,=_\\alpha\\)</span>、改名及自由变量递归先在原始树上定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_\\alpha\">\\(G_\\alpha\\)</span> 的星号闭包以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为载体，不预先在待定义的商上生成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"=_\\alpha\">\\(=_\\alpha\\)</span>。在绑定改名生成式及显示的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"=_\\alpha\">\\(=_\\alpha\\)</span> 等式中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z,W\">\\(z,W\\)</span> 均避开被改名原始树的全部变量。原始代入中的新变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span> 按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_t\">\\(V_t\\)</span> 的固定枚举选取避开当前表达式及代入表达式全部变量的首项；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> 按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_T\">\\(V_T\\)</span> 的枚举同样选取。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E[x\\mapsto z]\">\\(E[x\\mapsto z]\\)</span> 是下式的自由出现改名；用于绑定者的体时，嵌套同名绑定者处停止。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FTV}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\operatorname{FTV}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 的原始递归以有限偏函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma:V_t\\rightharpoonup\\mathcal A_\\lambda\">\\(\\Gamma:V_t\\rightharpoonup\\mathcal A_\\lambda\\)</span> 为输入；取商后，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 的值域改为对应类型商，逐项使用诱导的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FTV}\">\\(\\operatorname{FTV}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[E]_\\alpha\">\\([E]_\\alpha\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_\\alpha\">\\(\\mathcal E_\\alpha\\)</span> 在下式定义。自由变量、两种代入及构造子随后按显示等式下降到商；后续文件中的同名运算指这些诱导运算。三种归约 context 的文法仍生成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K_\\alpha\">\\(\\mathcal K_\\alpha\\)</span> 中的原始单孔树，绑定变量标签保持固定，context 本身不另取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 商；其对表达式类的作用由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C[[E]_\\alpha]\">\\(C[[E]_\\alpha]\\)</span> 的等式给出。归约生成式中的表达式取商上的诱导构造，且两端位于所用子语法。非依赖类型代入的参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\mathcal A_\\lambda\">\\(B\\in\\mathcal A_\\lambda\\)</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(B)=\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}(B)=\\varnothing\\)</span>；CoC 的项代入允许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\\in\\mathcal E\">\\(N\\in\\mathcal E\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal A_\\lambda&amp;::=U\\mid c\\mid\\mathcal A_\\lambda\\to\\mathcal A_\\lambda\\mid\\forall U.\\mathcal A_\\lambda,\\\\\nE_0&amp;:=V_t\\cup\\mathsf C\\cup\\mathcal A_\\lambda,\\\\\nE_{n+1}&amp;:=E_n\\cup\\{MN,\\lambda x:M.N,\\Pi x:M.N,\\Lambda U.M,M[A]:M,N\\in E_n,\\ x\\in V_t,\\ U\\in V_T,\\ A\\in\\mathcal A_\\lambda\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal E&amp;:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}E_n.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal A_\\lambda&amp;::=U\\mid c\\mid\\mathcal A_\\lambda\\to\\mathcal A_\\lambda\\mid\\forall U.\\mathcal A_\\lambda,\\\\\nE_0&amp;:=V_t\\cup\\mathsf C\\cup\\mathcal A_\\lambda,\\\\\nE_{n+1}&amp;:=E_n\\cup\\{MN,\\lambda x:M.N,\\Pi x:M.N,\\Lambda U.M,M[A]:M,N\\in E_n,\\ x\\in V_t,\\ U\\in V_T,\\ A\\in\\mathcal A_\\lambda\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal E&amp;:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}E_n.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal K_\\alpha::={}&amp;\\square\\mid\\mathcal K_\\alpha M\\mid M\\mathcal K_\\alpha\n\\mid b x:\\mathcal K_\\alpha.M\\mid b x:M.\\mathcal K_\\alpha\n\\mid\\Lambda U.\\mathcal K_\\alpha\\\\\n&amp;\\mid\\mathcal K_\\alpha[A]\\mid M[\\mathcal K_\\alpha]\n\\mid\\mathcal K_\\alpha\\to A\\mid A\\to\\mathcal K_\\alpha\n\\mid\\forall U.\\mathcal K_\\alpha.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal K_\\alpha::={}&amp;\\square\\mid\\mathcal K_\\alpha M\\mid M\\mathcal K_\\alpha\n\\mid b x:\\mathcal K_\\alpha.M\\mid b x:M.\\mathcal K_\\alpha\n\\mid\\Lambda U.\\mathcal K_\\alpha\\\\\n&amp;\\mid\\mathcal K_\\alpha[A]\\mid M[\\mathcal K_\\alpha]\n\\mid\\mathcal K_\\alpha\\to A\\mid A\\to\\mathcal K_\\alpha\n\\mid\\forall U.\\mathcal K_\\alpha.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(\\square,E,G)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow G=E,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(CM,E,G)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists H\\in\\mathcal E\\\n(\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(C,E,H)\\land G=HM),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(MC,E,G)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists H\\in\\mathcal E\\\n(\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(C,E,H)\\land G=MH),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(b x:C.M,E,G)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists H\\in\\mathcal E\\\n(\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(C,E,H)\\land G=b x:H.M),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(b x:M.C,E,G)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists H\\in\\mathcal E\\\n(\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(C,E,H)\\land G=b x:M.H),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(\\Lambda U.C,E,G)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists H\\in\\mathcal E\\\n(\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(C,E,H)\\land G=\\Lambda U.H),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(C[A],E,G)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists H\\in\\mathcal E\\\n(\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(C,E,H)\\land G=H[A]),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(M[C],E,G)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists B\\in\\mathcal A_\\lambda\\\n(\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(C,E,B)\\land G=M[B]),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(C\\to A,E,G)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists B\\in\\mathcal A_\\lambda\\\n(\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(C,E,B)\\land G=B\\to A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(A\\to C,E,G)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists B\\in\\mathcal A_\\lambda\\\n(\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(C,E,B)\\land G=A\\to B),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(\\forall U.C,E,G)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists B\\in\\mathcal A_\\lambda\\\n(\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(C,E,B)\\land G=\\forall U.B),\\\\\n\\forall C\\in\\mathcal K_\\alpha\\ \\forall E,G,H\\in\\mathcal E\\quad&amp;\n\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(C,E,G)\\land\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(C,E,H)\\Longrightarrow G=H,\\\\\n\\mathcal D_{\\rm fill}&amp;:=\\{\\langle C,E\\rangle\\in\\mathcal K_\\alpha\\times\\mathcal E:\n\\exists G\\in\\mathcal E\\ \\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(C,E,G)\\},\\\\\nC[E]&amp;:=\\iota G\\in\\mathcal E\\ \\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(C,E,G)\n\\quad(\\langle C,E\\rangle\\in\\mathcal D_{\\rm fill}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(\\square,E,G)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow G=E,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(CM,E,G)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists H\\in\\mathcal E\\\n(\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(C,E,H)\\land G=HM),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(MC,E,G)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists H\\in\\mathcal E\\\n(\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(C,E,H)\\land G=MH),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(b x:C.M,E,G)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists H\\in\\mathcal E\\\n(\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(C,E,H)\\land G=b x:H.M),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(b x:M.C,E,G)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists H\\in\\mathcal E\\\n(\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(C,E,H)\\land G=b x:M.H),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(\\Lambda U.C,E,G)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists H\\in\\mathcal E\\\n(\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(C,E,H)\\land G=\\Lambda U.H),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(C[A],E,G)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists H\\in\\mathcal E\\\n(\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(C,E,H)\\land G=H[A]),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(M[C],E,G)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists B\\in\\mathcal A_\\lambda\\\n(\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(C,E,B)\\land G=M[B]),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(C\\to A,E,G)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists B\\in\\mathcal A_\\lambda\\\n(\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(C,E,B)\\land G=B\\to A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(A\\to C,E,G)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists B\\in\\mathcal A_\\lambda\\\n(\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(C,E,B)\\land G=A\\to B),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(\\forall U.C,E,G)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists B\\in\\mathcal A_\\lambda\\\n(\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(C,E,B)\\land G=\\forall U.B),\\\\\n\\forall C\\in\\mathcal K_\\alpha\\ \\forall E,G,H\\in\\mathcal E\\quad&amp;\n\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(C,E,G)\\land\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(C,E,H)\\Longrightarrow G=H,\\\\\n\\mathcal D_{\\rm fill}&amp;:=\\{\\langle C,E\\rangle\\in\\mathcal K_\\alpha\\times\\mathcal E:\n\\exists G\\in\\mathcal E\\ \\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(C,E,G)\\},\\\\\nC[E]&amp;:=\\iota G\\in\\mathcal E\\ \\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(C,E,G)\n\\quad(\\langle C,E\\rangle\\in\\mathcal D_{\\rm fill}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{FV}(A)&amp;:=\\varnothing\\quad(A\\in\\mathcal A_\\lambda),\\qquad A[N/x]:=A\\quad(A\\in\\mathcal A_\\lambda),\\\\\nq[q\\mapsto r]&amp;:=r,\\quad v[q\\mapsto r]:=v\\ (v\\ne q),\\quad c[q\\mapsto r]:=c,\\\\\n(EF)[q\\mapsto r]&amp;:=(E[q\\mapsto r])(F[q\\mapsto r]),\\\\\n(E\\to F)[q\\mapsto r]&amp;:=E[q\\mapsto r]\\to F[q\\mapsto r],\\\\\n(b v:A.E)[q\\mapsto r]&amp;:=\\begin{cases}b v:A[q\\mapsto r].E,&amp;v=q,\\\\b v:A[q\\mapsto r].E[q\\mapsto r],&amp;v\\ne q,\\end{cases}\\\\\n(\\Lambda V.E)[q\\mapsto r]&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\\Lambda V.E,&amp;V=q,\\\\\\Lambda V.(E[q\\mapsto r]),&amp;V\\ne q,\\end{cases}\\\\\n(\\forall V.A)[q\\mapsto r]&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\\forall V.A,&amp;V=q,\\\\\\forall V.(A[q\\mapsto r]),&amp;V\\ne q,\\end{cases}\\\\\n(E[A])[q\\mapsto r]&amp;:=(E[q\\mapsto r])[A[q\\mapsto r]],\\\\\nG_\\alpha&amp;:=\\{\\langle C[b x:A.M],C[b z:A.(M[x\\mapsto z])]\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle C[\\Lambda U.M],C[\\Lambda W.(M[U\\mapsto W])]\\rangle\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\langle C[\\forall U.A],C[\\forall W.(A[U\\mapsto W])]\\rangle\\},\\\\\n=_\\alpha&amp;:=(G_\\alpha\\cup G_\\alpha^{-1})^*,\\\\\n[E]_\\alpha&amp;:=\\{F\\in\\mathcal E:E=_\\alpha F\\},\\qquad\\mathcal E_\\alpha:=\\{[E]_\\alpha:E\\in\\mathcal E\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{FV}(A)&amp;:=\\varnothing\\quad(A\\in\\mathcal A_\\lambda),\\qquad A[N/x]:=A\\quad(A\\in\\mathcal A_\\lambda),\\\\\nq[q\\mapsto r]&amp;:=r,\\quad v[q\\mapsto r]:=v\\ (v\\ne q),\\quad c[q\\mapsto r]:=c,\\\\\n(EF)[q\\mapsto r]&amp;:=(E[q\\mapsto r])(F[q\\mapsto r]),\\\\\n(E\\to F)[q\\mapsto r]&amp;:=E[q\\mapsto r]\\to F[q\\mapsto r],\\\\\n(b v:A.E)[q\\mapsto r]&amp;:=\\begin{cases}b v:A[q\\mapsto r].E,&amp;v=q,\\\\b v:A[q\\mapsto r].E[q\\mapsto r],&amp;v\\ne q,\\end{cases}\\\\\n(\\Lambda V.E)[q\\mapsto r]&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\\Lambda V.E,&amp;V=q,\\\\\\Lambda V.(E[q\\mapsto r]),&amp;V\\ne q,\\end{cases}\\\\\n(\\forall V.A)[q\\mapsto r]&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\\forall V.A,&amp;V=q,\\\\\\forall V.(A[q\\mapsto r]),&amp;V\\ne q,\\end{cases}\\\\\n(E[A])[q\\mapsto r]&amp;:=(E[q\\mapsto r])[A[q\\mapsto r]],\\\\\nG_\\alpha&amp;:=\\{\\langle C[b x:A.M],C[b z:A.(M[x\\mapsto z])]\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle C[\\Lambda U.M],C[\\Lambda W.(M[U\\mapsto W])]\\rangle\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\langle C[\\forall U.A],C[\\forall W.(A[U\\mapsto W])]\\rangle\\},\\\\\n=_\\alpha&amp;:=(G_\\alpha\\cup G_\\alpha^{-1})^*,\\\\\n[E]_\\alpha&amp;:=\\{F\\in\\mathcal E:E=_\\alpha F\\},\\qquad\\mathcal E_\\alpha:=\\{[E]_\\alpha:E\\in\\mathcal E\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{FV}(x)&amp;:=\\{x\\},&amp;\\operatorname{FV}(c)&amp;:=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(MN)&amp;:=\\operatorname{FV}(M)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(N),&amp;\n\\operatorname{FV}(b x:A.M)&amp;:=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup(\\operatorname{FV}(M)\\setminus\\{x\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\Lambda U.M)&amp;:=\\operatorname{FV}(M),&amp;\\operatorname{FV}(M[A])&amp;:=\\operatorname{FV}(M)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FTV}(U)&amp;:=\\{U\\},&amp;\\operatorname{FTV}(c)&amp;:=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\operatorname{FTV}(A\\to B)&amp;:=\\operatorname{FTV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FTV}(B),&amp;\\operatorname{FTV}(\\forall U.A)&amp;:=\\operatorname{FTV}(A)\\setminus\\{U\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{FTV}(x)&amp;:=\\varnothing,&amp;\\operatorname{FTV}(MN)&amp;:=\\operatorname{FTV}(M)\\cup\\operatorname{FTV}(N),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FTV}(b x:A.M)&amp;:=\\operatorname{FTV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FTV}(M),&amp;\\operatorname{FTV}(\\Lambda U.M)&amp;:=\\operatorname{FTV}(M)\\setminus\\{U\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{FTV}(M[A])&amp;:=\\operatorname{FTV}(M)\\cup\\operatorname{FTV}(A),&amp;\\operatorname{FTV}(\\Gamma)&amp;:=\\bigcup_{x\\in\\operatorname{dom}\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FTV}(\\Gamma(x)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{FV}(x)&amp;:=\\{x\\},&amp;\\operatorname{FV}(c)&amp;:=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(MN)&amp;:=\\operatorname{FV}(M)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(N),&amp;\n\\operatorname{FV}(b x:A.M)&amp;:=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup(\\operatorname{FV}(M)\\setminus\\{x\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\Lambda U.M)&amp;:=\\operatorname{FV}(M),&amp;\\operatorname{FV}(M[A])&amp;:=\\operatorname{FV}(M)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FTV}(U)&amp;:=\\{U\\},&amp;\\operatorname{FTV}(c)&amp;:=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\operatorname{FTV}(A\\to B)&amp;:=\\operatorname{FTV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FTV}(B),&amp;\\operatorname{FTV}(\\forall U.A)&amp;:=\\operatorname{FTV}(A)\\setminus\\{U\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{FTV}(x)&amp;:=\\varnothing,&amp;\\operatorname{FTV}(MN)&amp;:=\\operatorname{FTV}(M)\\cup\\operatorname{FTV}(N),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FTV}(b x:A.M)&amp;:=\\operatorname{FTV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FTV}(M),&amp;\\operatorname{FTV}(\\Lambda U.M)&amp;:=\\operatorname{FTV}(M)\\setminus\\{U\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{FTV}(M[A])&amp;:=\\operatorname{FTV}(M)\\cup\\operatorname{FTV}(A),&amp;\\operatorname{FTV}(\\Gamma)&amp;:=\\bigcup_{x\\in\\operatorname{dom}\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FTV}(\\Gamma(x)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nx[N/x]&amp;:=N,&amp; y[N/x]&amp;:=y\\quad(y\\ne x),&amp;c[N/x]&amp;:=c,\\\\\n(ML)[N/x]&amp;:=(M[N/x])(L[N/x]),\\\\\n(b y:A.M)[N/x]&amp;:=\\begin{cases}b x:A[N/x].M,&amp;y=x,\\\\b z:A[N/x].((M[y\\mapsto z])[N/x]),&amp;y\\ne x,\\end{cases}\\\\\n(\\Lambda U.M)[N/x]&amp;:=\\Lambda W.((M[U\\mapsto W])[N/x]),\\\\\n(M[A])[N/x]&amp;:=(M[N/x])[A[N/x]].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nx[N/x]&amp;:=N,&amp; y[N/x]&amp;:=y\\quad(y\\ne x),&amp;c[N/x]&amp;:=c,\\\\\n(ML)[N/x]&amp;:=(M[N/x])(L[N/x]),\\\\\n(b y:A.M)[N/x]&amp;:=\\begin{cases}b x:A[N/x].M,&amp;y=x,\\\\b z:A[N/x].((M[y\\mapsto z])[N/x]),&amp;y\\ne x,\\end{cases}\\\\\n(\\Lambda U.M)[N/x]&amp;:=\\Lambda W.((M[U\\mapsto W])[N/x]),\\\\\n(M[A])[N/x]&amp;:=(M[N/x])[A[N/x]].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nU[B/U]&amp;:=B,&amp; V[B/U]&amp;:=V\\ (V\\ne U),&amp;c[B/U]&amp;:=c,&amp;x[B/U]&amp;:=x,\\\\\n(A\\to A&#39;)[B/U]&amp;:=A[B/U]\\to A&#39;[B/U],\\\\\n(\\forall V.A)[B/U]&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\\forall U.A,&amp;V=U,\\\\\\forall W.((A[V\\mapsto W])[B/U]),&amp;V\\ne U,\\end{cases}\\\\\n(MN)[B/U]&amp;:=(M[B/U])(N[B/U]),\\\\\n(b x:A.M)[B/U]&amp;:=b x:A[B/U].M[B/U],\\\\\n(\\Lambda V.M)[B/U]&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\\Lambda U.M,&amp;V=U,\\\\\\Lambda W.((M[V\\mapsto W])[B/U]),&amp;V\\ne U,\\end{cases}\\\\\n(M[A])[B/U]&amp;:=(M[B/U])[A[B/U]].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nU[B/U]&amp;:=B,&amp; V[B/U]&amp;:=V\\ (V\\ne U),&amp;c[B/U]&amp;:=c,&amp;x[B/U]&amp;:=x,\\\\\n(A\\to A&#39;)[B/U]&amp;:=A[B/U]\\to A&#39;[B/U],\\\\\n(\\forall V.A)[B/U]&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\\forall U.A,&amp;V=U,\\\\\\forall W.((A[V\\mapsto W])[B/U]),&amp;V\\ne U,\\end{cases}\\\\\n(MN)[B/U]&amp;:=(M[B/U])(N[B/U]),\\\\\n(b x:A.M)[B/U]&amp;:=b x:A[B/U].M[B/U],\\\\\n(\\Lambda V.M)[B/U]&amp;:=\\begin{cases}\\Lambda U.M,&amp;V=U,\\\\\\Lambda W.((M[V\\mapsto W])[B/U]),&amp;V\\ne U,\\end{cases}\\\\\n(M[A])[B/U]&amp;:=(M[B/U])[A[B/U]].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nb x:A.M&amp;=_{\\alpha}b z:A.(M[x\\mapsto z]),\\\\\n\\Lambda U.M&amp;=_{\\alpha}\\Lambda W.(M[U\\mapsto W]),\\qquad\n\\forall U.A=_{\\alpha}\\forall W.(A[U\\mapsto W]).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nb x:A.M&amp;=_{\\alpha}b z:A.(M[x\\mapsto z]),\\\\\n\\Lambda U.M&amp;=_{\\alpha}\\Lambda W.(M[U\\mapsto W]),\\qquad\n\\forall U.A=_{\\alpha}\\forall W.(A[U\\mapsto W]).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{FV}([E]_\\alpha)&amp;:=\\operatorname{FV}(E),\\qquad\\operatorname{FTV}([E]_\\alpha):=\\operatorname{FTV}(E),\\\\\n\\langle C,E\\rangle\\in\\mathcal D_{\\rm fill}\\land E=_\\alpha F&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\langle C,F\\rangle\\in\\mathcal D_{\\rm fill}\\land C[E]=_\\alpha C[F],\\\\\nC[[E]_\\alpha]&amp;:=[C[E]]_\\alpha\\quad(\\langle C,E\\rangle\\in\\mathcal D_{\\rm fill}),\\\\\n[E]_\\alpha[[N]_\\alpha/x]&amp;:=[E[N/x]]_\\alpha,\\qquad\n[E]_\\alpha[[B]_\\alpha/U]:=[E[B/U]]_\\alpha,\\\\\n[M]_\\alpha[N]_\\alpha&amp;:=[MN]_\\alpha,\\qquad\nb x:[A]_\\alpha.[M]_\\alpha:=[b x:A.M]_\\alpha,\\\\\n\\Lambda U.[M]_\\alpha&amp;:=[\\Lambda U.M]_\\alpha,\\qquad\n[M]_\\alpha[[A]_\\alpha]:=[M[A]]_\\alpha,\\\\\n[A]_\\alpha\\to[B]_\\alpha&amp;:=[A\\to B]_\\alpha,\\qquad\n\\forall U.[A]_\\alpha:=[\\forall U.A]_\\alpha.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{FV}([E]_\\alpha)&amp;:=\\operatorname{FV}(E),\\qquad\\operatorname{FTV}([E]_\\alpha):=\\operatorname{FTV}(E),\\\\\n\\langle C,E\\rangle\\in\\mathcal D_{\\rm fill}\\land E=_\\alpha F&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\langle C,F\\rangle\\in\\mathcal D_{\\rm fill}\\land C[E]=_\\alpha C[F],\\\\\nC[[E]_\\alpha]&amp;:=[C[E]]_\\alpha\\quad(\\langle C,E\\rangle\\in\\mathcal D_{\\rm fill}),\\\\\n[E]_\\alpha[[N]_\\alpha/x]&amp;:=[E[N/x]]_\\alpha,\\qquad\n[E]_\\alpha[[B]_\\alpha/U]:=[E[B/U]]_\\alpha,\\\\\n[M]_\\alpha[N]_\\alpha&amp;:=[MN]_\\alpha,\\qquad\nb x:[A]_\\alpha.[M]_\\alpha:=[b x:A.M]_\\alpha,\\\\\n\\Lambda U.[M]_\\alpha&amp;:=[\\Lambda U.M]_\\alpha,\\qquad\n[M]_\\alpha[[A]_\\alpha]:=[M[A]]_\\alpha,\\\\\n[A]_\\alpha\\to[B]_\\alpha&amp;:=[A\\to B]_\\alpha,\\qquad\n\\forall U.[A]_\\alpha:=[\\forall U.A]_\\alpha.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal C_\\lambda&amp;::=\\square\\mid\\mathcal C_\\lambda M\\mid M\\mathcal C_\\lambda\\mid\\lambda x:A.\\mathcal C_\\lambda,\\\\\n\\mathcal C_F&amp;::=\\square\\mid\\mathcal C_F M\\mid M\\mathcal C_F\\mid\\lambda x:A.\\mathcal C_F\\mid\\Lambda U.\\mathcal C_F\\mid\\mathcal C_F[A],\\\\\n\\mathcal C_C&amp;::=\\square\\mid\\mathcal C_C M\\mid M\\mathcal C_C\\mid\\lambda x:\\mathcal C_C.M\\mid\\lambda x:A.\\mathcal C_C\\mid\\Pi x:\\mathcal C_C.B\\mid\\Pi x:A.\\mathcal C_C,\\\\\n\\beta_\\lambda&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\mathcal C_\\lambda[(\\lambda x:A.M)N],\\mathcal C_\\lambda[M[N/x]]\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\beta_F&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\mathcal C_F[(\\lambda x:A.M)N],\\mathcal C_F[M[N/x]]\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle\\mathcal C_F[(\\Lambda U.M)[B]],\\mathcal C_F[M[B/U]]\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\beta_C&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\mathcal C_C[(\\lambda x:A.M)N],\\mathcal C_C[M[N/x]]\\rangle\\},\\\\\nR^*&amp;:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}R^n,\\quad R^0:=\\{\\langle M,M\\rangle:M\\in X\\},\\quad R^{n+1}:=R^n\\circ R,\\\\\n=_R&amp;:=(R\\cup R^{-1})^*.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal C_\\lambda&amp;::=\\square\\mid\\mathcal C_\\lambda M\\mid M\\mathcal C_\\lambda\\mid\\lambda x:A.\\mathcal C_\\lambda,\\\\\n\\mathcal C_F&amp;::=\\square\\mid\\mathcal C_F M\\mid M\\mathcal C_F\\mid\\lambda x:A.\\mathcal C_F\\mid\\Lambda U.\\mathcal C_F\\mid\\mathcal C_F[A],\\\\\n\\mathcal C_C&amp;::=\\square\\mid\\mathcal C_C M\\mid M\\mathcal C_C\\mid\\lambda x:\\mathcal C_C.M\\mid\\lambda x:A.\\mathcal C_C\\mid\\Pi x:\\mathcal C_C.B\\mid\\Pi x:A.\\mathcal C_C,\\\\\n\\beta_\\lambda&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\mathcal C_\\lambda[(\\lambda x:A.M)N],\\mathcal C_\\lambda[M[N/x]]\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\beta_F&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\mathcal C_F[(\\lambda x:A.M)N],\\mathcal C_F[M[N/x]]\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle\\mathcal C_F[(\\Lambda U.M)[B]],\\mathcal C_F[M[B/U]]\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\beta_C&amp;:=\\{\\langle\\mathcal C_C[(\\lambda x:A.M)N],\\mathcal C_C[M[N/x]]\\rangle\\},\\\\\nR^*&amp;:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}R^n,\\quad R^0:=\\{\\langle M,M\\rangle:M\\in X\\},\\quad R^{n+1}:=R^n\\circ R,\\\\\n=_R&amp;:=(R\\cup R^{-1})^*.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>代入按有限树递归，改名后递归只进入原体的真子树；不同新变量选择产生相同α类，因此等式定义全函数。所有context只在给定子语法中合法时实例化。F的类型无内部归约；CoC的注解、Π域与Π体均有兼容归约。α关系取所示改名等式生成的最小兼容等价关系，而非原始字符串相等。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"V_t,V_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Base}\\subseteq\\mathsf C","display":false},{"tex":"x,y,z\\in V_t","display":false},{"tex":"U,V,W\\in V_T","display":false},{"tex":"A,B","display":false},{"tex":"M,N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A_\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"x,c,MN,\\lambda x:A.M,\\Pi x:A.B,\\Lambda U.M,M[A]","display":false},{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"V_t","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in\\{\\lambda,\\Pi\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"E,F,G,H,L,M,N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"A,A',B\\in\\mathcal A_\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda/\\Pi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"q,r\\in V_t\\cup V_T","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"v\\in V_t\\cup V_T","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in\\mathsf{Base}","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in\\mathsf C","display":false},{"tex":"\\square\\notin\\mathsf C\\cup V_t\\cup V_T","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal K_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(C,E,G)","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"C[E]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D_{\\rm fill}","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota","display":false},{"tex":"G_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq X^2","display":false},{"tex":"G_\\alpha,=_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"G_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"=_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"=_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"z,W","display":false},{"tex":"z","display":false},{"tex":"V_t","display":false},{"tex":"W","display":false},{"tex":"V_T","display":false},{"tex":"E[x\\mapsto z]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FTV}(\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma:V_t\\rightharpoonup\\mathcal A_\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FTV}","display":false},{"tex":"[E]_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal K_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"C[[E]_\\alpha]","display":false},{"tex":"B\\in\\mathcal A_\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}(B)=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"N\\in\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal A_\\lambda&::=U\\mid c\\mid\\mathcal A_\\lambda\\to\\mathcal A_\\lambda\\mid\\forall U.\\mathcal A_\\lambda,\\\\\nE_0&:=V_t\\cup\\mathsf C\\cup\\mathcal A_\\lambda,\\\\\nE_{n+1}&:=E_n\\cup\\{MN,\\lambda x:M.N,\\Pi x:M.N,\\Lambda U.M,M[A]:M,N\\in E_n,\\ x\\in V_t,\\ U\\in V_T,\\ A\\in\\mathcal A_\\lambda\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal E&:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}E_n.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal K_\\alpha::={}&\\square\\mid\\mathcal K_\\alpha M\\mid M\\mathcal K_\\alpha\n\\mid b x:\\mathcal K_\\alpha.M\\mid b x:M.\\mathcal K_\\alpha\n\\mid\\Lambda U.\\mathcal K_\\alpha\\\\\n&\\mid\\mathcal K_\\alpha[A]\\mid M[\\mathcal K_\\alpha]\n\\mid\\mathcal K_\\alpha\\to A\\mid A\\to\\mathcal K_\\alpha\n\\mid\\forall U.\\mathcal K_\\alpha.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(\\square,E,G)&:\\Longleftrightarrow G=E,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(CM,E,G)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists H\\in\\mathcal E\\\n(\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(C,E,H)\\land G=HM),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(MC,E,G)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists H\\in\\mathcal E\\\n(\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(C,E,H)\\land G=MH),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(b x:C.M,E,G)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists H\\in\\mathcal E\\\n(\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(C,E,H)\\land G=b x:H.M),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(b x:M.C,E,G)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists H\\in\\mathcal E\\\n(\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(C,E,H)\\land G=b x:M.H),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(\\Lambda U.C,E,G)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists H\\in\\mathcal E\\\n(\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(C,E,H)\\land G=\\Lambda U.H),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(C[A],E,G)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists H\\in\\mathcal E\\\n(\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(C,E,H)\\land G=H[A]),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(M[C],E,G)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists B\\in\\mathcal A_\\lambda\\\n(\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(C,E,B)\\land G=M[B]),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(C\\to A,E,G)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists B\\in\\mathcal A_\\lambda\\\n(\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(C,E,B)\\land G=B\\to A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(A\\to C,E,G)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists B\\in\\mathcal A_\\lambda\\\n(\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(C,E,B)\\land G=A\\to B),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(\\forall U.C,E,G)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists B\\in\\mathcal A_\\lambda\\\n(\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(C,E,B)\\land G=\\forall U.B),\\\\\n\\forall C\\in\\mathcal K_\\alpha\\ \\forall E,G,H\\in\\mathcal E\\quad&\n\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(C,E,G)\\land\\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(C,E,H)\\Longrightarrow G=H,\\\\\n\\mathcal D_{\\rm fill}&:=\\{\\langle C,E\\rangle\\in\\mathcal K_\\alpha\\times\\mathcal E:\n\\exists G\\in\\mathcal E\\ \\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(C,E,G)\\},\\\\\nC[E]&:=\\iota G\\in\\mathcal E\\ \\operatorname{Fill}_\\alpha(C,E,G)\n\\quad(\\langle C,E\\rangle\\in\\mathcal D_{\\rm fill}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{FV}(A)&:=\\varnothing\\quad(A\\in\\mathcal A_\\lambda),\\qquad A[N/x]:=A\\quad(A\\in\\mathcal A_\\lambda),\\\\\nq[q\\mapsto r]&:=r,\\quad v[q\\mapsto r]:=v\\ (v\\ne q),\\quad c[q\\mapsto r]:=c,\\\\\n(EF)[q\\mapsto r]&:=(E[q\\mapsto r])(F[q\\mapsto r]),\\\\\n(E\\to F)[q\\mapsto r]&:=E[q\\mapsto r]\\to F[q\\mapsto r],\\\\\n(b v:A.E)[q\\mapsto r]&:=\\begin{cases}b v:A[q\\mapsto r].E,&v=q,\\\\b v:A[q\\mapsto r].E[q\\mapsto r],&v\\ne q,\\end{cases}\\\\\n(\\Lambda V.E)[q\\mapsto r]&:=\\begin{cases}\\Lambda V.E,&V=q,\\\\\\Lambda V.(E[q\\mapsto r]),&V\\ne q,\\end{cases}\\\\\n(\\forall V.A)[q\\mapsto r]&:=\\begin{cases}\\forall V.A,&V=q,\\\\\\forall V.(A[q\\mapsto r]),&V\\ne q,\\end{cases}\\\\\n(E[A])[q\\mapsto r]&:=(E[q\\mapsto r])[A[q\\mapsto r]],\\\\\nG_\\alpha&:=\\{\\langle C[b x:A.M],C[b z:A.(M[x\\mapsto z])]\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle C[\\Lambda U.M],C[\\Lambda W.(M[U\\mapsto W])]\\rangle\\}\\\\\n&\\quad\\cup\\{\\langle C[\\forall U.A],C[\\forall W.(A[U\\mapsto W])]\\rangle\\},\\\\\n=_\\alpha&:=(G_\\alpha\\cup G_\\alpha^{-1})^*,\\\\\n[E]_\\alpha&:=\\{F\\in\\mathcal E:E=_\\alpha F\\},\\qquad\\mathcal E_\\alpha:=\\{[E]_\\alpha:E\\in\\mathcal E\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{FV}(x)&:=\\{x\\},&\\operatorname{FV}(c)&:=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(MN)&:=\\operatorname{FV}(M)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(N),&\n\\operatorname{FV}(b x:A.M)&:=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup(\\operatorname{FV}(M)\\setminus\\{x\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\Lambda U.M)&:=\\operatorname{FV}(M),&\\operatorname{FV}(M[A])&:=\\operatorname{FV}(M)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FTV}(U)&:=\\{U\\},&\\operatorname{FTV}(c)&:=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\operatorname{FTV}(A\\to B)&:=\\operatorname{FTV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FTV}(B),&\\operatorname{FTV}(\\forall U.A)&:=\\operatorname{FTV}(A)\\setminus\\{U\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{FTV}(x)&:=\\varnothing,&\\operatorname{FTV}(MN)&:=\\operatorname{FTV}(M)\\cup\\operatorname{FTV}(N),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FTV}(b x:A.M)&:=\\operatorname{FTV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FTV}(M),&\\operatorname{FTV}(\\Lambda U.M)&:=\\operatorname{FTV}(M)\\setminus\\{U\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{FTV}(M[A])&:=\\operatorname{FTV}(M)\\cup\\operatorname{FTV}(A),&\\operatorname{FTV}(\\Gamma)&:=\\bigcup_{x\\in\\operatorname{dom}\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FTV}(\\Gamma(x)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nx[N/x]&:=N,& y[N/x]&:=y\\quad(y\\ne x),&c[N/x]&:=c,\\\\\n(ML)[N/x]&:=(M[N/x])(L[N/x]),\\\\\n(b y:A.M)[N/x]&:=\\begin{cases}b x:A[N/x].M,&y=x,\\\\b z:A[N/x].((M[y\\mapsto z])[N/x]),&y\\ne x,\\end{cases}\\\\\n(\\Lambda U.M)[N/x]&:=\\Lambda W.((M[U\\mapsto W])[N/x]),\\\\\n(M[A])[N/x]&:=(M[N/x])[A[N/x]].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nU[B/U]&:=B,& V[B/U]&:=V\\ (V\\ne U),&c[B/U]&:=c,&x[B/U]&:=x,\\\\\n(A\\to A')[B/U]&:=A[B/U]\\to A'[B/U],\\\\\n(\\forall V.A)[B/U]&:=\\begin{cases}\\forall U.A,&V=U,\\\\\\forall W.((A[V\\mapsto W])[B/U]),&V\\ne U,\\end{cases}\\\\\n(MN)[B/U]&:=(M[B/U])(N[B/U]),\\\\\n(b x:A.M)[B/U]&:=b x:A[B/U].M[B/U],\\\\\n(\\Lambda V.M)[B/U]&:=\\begin{cases}\\Lambda U.M,&V=U,\\\\\\Lambda W.((M[V\\mapsto W])[B/U]),&V\\ne U,\\end{cases}\\\\\n(M[A])[B/U]&:=(M[B/U])[A[B/U]].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nb x:A.M&=_{\\alpha}b z:A.(M[x\\mapsto z]),\\\\\n\\Lambda U.M&=_{\\alpha}\\Lambda W.(M[U\\mapsto W]),\\qquad\n\\forall U.A=_{\\alpha}\\forall W.(A[U\\mapsto W]).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{FV}([E]_\\alpha)&:=\\operatorname{FV}(E),\\qquad\\operatorname{FTV}([E]_\\alpha):=\\operatorname{FTV}(E),\\\\\n\\langle C,E\\rangle\\in\\mathcal D_{\\rm fill}\\land E=_\\alpha F&\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\langle C,F\\rangle\\in\\mathcal D_{\\rm fill}\\land C[E]=_\\alpha C[F],\\\\\nC[[E]_\\alpha]&:=[C[E]]_\\alpha\\quad(\\langle C,E\\rangle\\in\\mathcal D_{\\rm fill}),\\\\\n[E]_\\alpha[[N]_\\alpha/x]&:=[E[N/x]]_\\alpha,\\qquad\n[E]_\\alpha[[B]_\\alpha/U]:=[E[B/U]]_\\alpha,\\\\\n[M]_\\alpha[N]_\\alpha&:=[MN]_\\alpha,\\qquad\nb x:[A]_\\alpha.[M]_\\alpha:=[b x:A.M]_\\alpha,\\\\\n\\Lambda U.[M]_\\alpha&:=[\\Lambda U.M]_\\alpha,\\qquad\n[M]_\\alpha[[A]_\\alpha]:=[M[A]]_\\alpha,\\\\\n[A]_\\alpha\\to[B]_\\alpha&:=[A\\to B]_\\alpha,\\qquad\n\\forall U.[A]_\\alpha:=[\\forall U.A]_\\alpha.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal C_\\lambda&::=\\square\\mid\\mathcal C_\\lambda M\\mid M\\mathcal C_\\lambda\\mid\\lambda x:A.\\mathcal C_\\lambda,\\\\\n\\mathcal C_F&::=\\square\\mid\\mathcal C_F M\\mid M\\mathcal C_F\\mid\\lambda x:A.\\mathcal C_F\\mid\\Lambda U.\\mathcal C_F\\mid\\mathcal C_F[A],\\\\\n\\mathcal C_C&::=\\square\\mid\\mathcal C_C M\\mid M\\mathcal C_C\\mid\\lambda x:\\mathcal C_C.M\\mid\\lambda x:A.\\mathcal C_C\\mid\\Pi x:\\mathcal C_C.B\\mid\\Pi x:A.\\mathcal C_C,\\\\\n\\beta_\\lambda&:=\\{\\langle\\mathcal C_\\lambda[(\\lambda x:A.M)N],\\mathcal C_\\lambda[M[N/x]]\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\beta_F&:=\\{\\langle\\mathcal C_F[(\\lambda x:A.M)N],\\mathcal C_F[M[N/x]]\\rangle\\}\\cup\\{\\langle\\mathcal C_F[(\\Lambda U.M)[B]],\\mathcal C_F[M[B/U]]\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\beta_C&:=\\{\\langle\\mathcal C_C[(\\lambda x:A.M)N],\\mathcal C_C[M[N/x]]\\rangle\\},\\\\\nR^*&:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}R^n,\\quad R^0:=\\{\\langle M,M\\rangle:M\\in X\\},\\quad R^{n+1}:=R^n\\circ R,\\\\\n=_R&:=(R\\cup R^{-1})^*.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":11748,"backlinks":[{"id":"77d1a531e7662d98","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Type}\\in\\mathsf C$ 是不同原始常元，常元集合 $\\mathsf C$、$V_t$、原始语法及诱导的避免捕获代入、$\\beta_C$ 和 $=_{\\beta_C}$ 见 [[72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction]]。下式 $E_n$ 只含原始树；$\\mathcal E_C$ 是它们在同一上游 $\\alpha$ 商中的像。规则中的构造子指诱导商运算；变量在项位置缩写其 $\\alpha$ 类，常元在 sort 和判断位置也缩写其原始树的 $\\alpha$ 类。"},{"id":"b4e2c27ac178897e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction]] 的有限原始树、α等价及诱导的商运算。$\\mathsf0\\in\\mathsf{Base}$ 是类型标签，$\\mathbf0$ 是项常元，二者不同；$\\mathbf0,\\mathsf S,\\mathsf R_\\sigma$（$\\sigma\\in\\mathcal{Ty}$）是该上游常元集合 $\\mathsf C$ 中的互异元素。每个类型 $\\sigma$ 有可数无限变量集 $V_\\sigma$，这些集合两两不交；$x^\\sigma\\in V_\\sigma$。有限上下文只给变量其固有类型。"},{"id":"e38d92d6727e7ead","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction]] 的有限自由树、$\\alpha$ 类及 $\\beta_\\lambda$。$\\mathsf B=\\mathsf{Base}\\ne\\varnothing$，$\\mathsf{Var}=V_t$。"},{"id":"a59aab1599221f4a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction]] 的 $V_t,V_T$、$\\operatorname{FTV}$、两种避免捕获代入与 $\\beta_F$。$\\Gamma:V_t\\rightharpoonup\\mathsf{Ty}_F$ 为有限偏函数。全部类型为开放类型，不设置额外kind层；$x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}\\Gamma$ 才可扩充。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-447","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction|df-lambda-binding-and-reduction]]"},{"id":"6061af339630925b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Gamma,\\Lambda_F,\\mathsf{Ty}_F,\\vdash_F$、项及类型的避免捕获替换取 [[72-df-system-f]] 与 [[72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction]]。"},{"id":"a07a3ec2073ac7ee","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$C$ 遍历对应项语法的合法单孔context；自由变量函数及β关系见 [[72-df-lambda-binding-and-reduction]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}